+    /* ---------------------------------------------------------------
+       Decorative icons & flourishes (CSS generated content)
+       All generated content here is purely decorative: the visible
+       text (headings, button labels) already conveys the meaning, so
+       glyphs use `content: "x" / ""` (empty alt text) to stay silent
